// N27-O — Pacto de la Cadena: the Warlock's Chain-boon summoned fiend.
//
// `pact_chain_summon: true` is the only thing that distinguishes this from
// any other `BasicSummon` ability (Conjuration spells, boss/NPC adds): it
// opts this specific cast into `common::comp::pact`'s point-pool gate and
// ledger, both client-side (`CharacterAbility::requirements_paid`) and
// server-side (`server::events::entity_creation::handle_create_npc`). The
// per-creature point cost is NEVER authored here — it is derived from the
// summoned body's combat rating (`comp::pact::summon_cost`), cached once per
// `Body` and shared by both gates so the two can never disagree.
//
// `BipedSmall(Husk)` is the cheapest creature in the shipped Cadena roster
// (`comp::pact::summon_cost`'s regression test pins `Husk` as the floor of
// the ordering) — deliberately, so a level-1 Warlock's starting 2-point pool
// (`chain_pool(1, 0) == 2`) can always afford at least one fiend. Re-casting
// repeatedly builds up a small chain of fiends, bounded by the pool rather
// than by a flat count — that IS the boon.
//
// `duration: Some(..)` (a lifetime cap) is required alongside the summon
// dying in combat — see the acceptance bar's "both, not either/or" on
// leak-freedom. `has_health: true` and the default `with_agent: true` put it
// on the same real-agent, hittable, pet-behaviour-tree-driven footing as
// every other owned summon in the game (no new AI, no new anchor/lifetime
// mechanism — see `basic_summon.rs` and `server/src/pet.rs`).
BasicSummon(
    buildup_duration: 0.8,
    cast_duration: 0.4,
    recover_duration: 0.5,
    summon_info: Npc(
        summoned_amount: 1,
        summon_distance: (1.5, 3.0),
        body: BipedSmall((species: Husk, body_type: Male)),
        scale: None,
        has_health: true,
        use_npc_name: true,
        loadout_config: None,
        skillset_config: None,
        duration: Some((secs: 300, nanos: 0)),
        pact_chain_summon: true,
    ),
    meta: (
        requirements: (min_level: Some(1)),
        cooldown: Some(4.0),
    ),
)
